  "contentHtml": "<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">지역별로 에어로켓 제작 기준이 다르다고 알고 있습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">제가 속한 지역은 에어로켓 발사대, 작년에 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">45</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">만원에 구입하였습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">수제작이라 별도의 모델명은 없어도 매우 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">우수한 제품으로,</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"> </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">과학교재상을 통해 구입하였습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.&nbsp;</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</SPAN></P>\r\n<P>\r\n<P style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">탄두 부분은 경험상 길쭉한 모양보다 다소 뭉특한 모양이 더 멀리 정확하게 날아갔습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. (광역시대회 은상 수상^^)</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P></SPAN></SPAN>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<P style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">작년에 우리 학교 학생이 날개 부분 제작에 사용했던 파일을 올립니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3D424t%26dataid%3D65%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20150402133130&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile273.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F27495D43551CC6003A7195')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_hwp_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 에어로켓날개도안(1).hwp</a></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3D424t%26dataid%3D65%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20150402133130&